Original commit body from afc727a:

Extract symbol resolution logic into a shared framework that can be reused
across all language analyzers. The SymbolResolver provides:
- Suffix-based module matching (finds backend.app.crud for app.crud)
- Go-style path hints for disambiguation
- Lazy index building for performance
- Confidence tracking for fuzzy vs exact matches

Integrated with Python analyzer, replacing the per-analyzer implementation.
Designed for reuse in Go, TypeScript, and other language analyzers.
